Subject: name the desktop entry Kalk, with Calculator as its generic name

numbat's entry is already named Calculator, and two visible entries that share
a name cannot be told apart in the launcher.

--- a/org.kde.kalk.desktop
+++ b/org.kde.kalk.desktop
@@ -2,7 +2,8 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
 
 [Desktop Entry]
-Name=Calculator
+Name=Kalk
+GenericName=Calculator
 Name[ar]=حاسبة
 Name[ast]=Calculadora
 Name[az]=Hesablayıcı
